  "body": "This change marks the rest of the interfaces exposed by WebUSB with the\n[SecureContext] extended attribute so that they do not appear in\nin-secure contexts. This is not strictly necessary since the partial\nNavigator interface is the entry-point to this API but it prevents\ndeveloper confusion by making the API clearly unavailable.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://pr-preview.s3.amazonaws.com/reillyeon/webusb/pull/142.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 7, 2018, 12:43 AM GMT (a803abd)\">Preview</a> | <a href=\"https://pr-preview.s3.amazonaws.com/WICG/webusb/142/6e68cb5...reillyeon:a803abd.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 7, 2018, 12:43 AM GMT (a803abd)\">Diff</a>",
